XB-Kidux-Name-es: Juegos de Blockly
XB-Kidux-Description-es: Rompecabezas con bloques: un laberinto, un pájaro, una tortuga, una película y música, cada vez un paso más difícil.
XB-Kidux-Ages: 6-12
XB-Kidux-Before: scratchjr
Description: Kidux learning module: Blockly Games, puzzles with blocks
 Kidux is a Debian derivative for a child's first computer. This learning
 module is Blockly Games: a set of puzzles that teach, one step harder each
 time, the ideas behind programming with blocks, a maze, a bird, a turtle
 that draws, a movie and music, served on this computer and shown in
 Chromium, in the child's language, without the internet.
 .
 Once it is installed, an adult switches it on for each child on the
 Modules page of the adult panel.
